Q: why we choose CompletableFuture..?
Ans: it help to write asynchronous programming and no blocking code where we call concurrently
    and we can run N no of task in separate thread without blocking main thread.

    when the task is complete it will notify to main thread (whether the task was completed of failed).

    there are different way to implement asynchronous programming in java using any of the below mechanisms for
     example you can use Futures, ExecutorService, Callback interfaces,
     Thread Pools etc.

      1: it cannot be manually complete
      2: multiple future cannot be chained together
      3: we can not combine multiple futures together
      4: No Proper Exception Handling mechanism

